DTSTAMP:20260729T101605Z
DESCRIPTION:Poster design by Jahan Singh Bakshi and Prashant C\nAmid dense traffic and long working days\, auto-rickshaw drivers Mohana and Leela Rani fight for visibility and respect in Chennai while facing a lack of infrastructure\, parking facilities\, harassment\, and social prejudice. Together with other female drivers\, they stand at the forefront of a growing movement of women who are taking the wheel and\, step by step\, leading a quiet mobility revolution in a male-dominated sector.\n\nJoin us for the screening of Auto Queens\, and then for a conversation with the producer\, Sarabhi Varsini and Mohana\, moderated by Sruthi Krishnan on cooperative organising\, women's labour\, and collective agency. 
DTEND:20260802T120000Z
DTSTART:20260802T103000Z
SUMMARY:Auto Queens
